Change contents as needed of the files in directory `parameters' and
 'inputs'. The contents are self-explanatory. Do not rename any of the
 above files.

Other contents are related to your particular thesis and should be
named and input in buetcsepgthesis.tex (you will want to rename this
file).

Bibliography entries are in:
    buetcsepgthesis.bib

You can choose one of the bibliography styles (ACM, IEEE, or alpha) by
commenting/uncommenting respective lines in buetcsepgthesisbibliography.tex.

Should you need to suppress the,
   list of figures,
   list of tables, or
   list of algorithms
uncomment the following lines as needed in buetcsepgthesis.tex:

%\suppresslistoffigures 
%\suppresslistoftables
%\suppresslistofalgorithms

